The reference to the key holding the store passphrase, as in
`from backup/sec/lab key passphrase`.

The key is decoded by the agent and installed in a 0600 file of a private
0700 directory under the agent run directory. The driver passes the file
path to `plakar` with `-keyfile`: the passphrase is never on a command line,
in an environment variable or in a log.

The snapshots are encrypted on the node, index included. Losing the
passphrase makes them unrecoverable.
